href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Exhausted_(Condition)\" title=\"Exhausted (Condition)\">Exhausted</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Lack of rest has left you exhausted. There are six levels of exhaustion, and each level is worse than the last. Completing a <a href=\"/wiki/Long_Rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long Rest\">Long Rest</a> reduces your exhaustion level by 1.\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr><tr id=\"Worn_Out\">\n\n<th scope=\"row\">\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 4px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Worn_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Worn Out (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Worn Out\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Exhausted_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Worn_Out_(Condition)\" title=\"Worn Out (Condition)\">Worn Out</a></span></th>\n<td style=\"vertical-align: middle;\">\n<p>Feeling utterly exhausted. It could just be the long day...\n</p>\n</td>\n\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202745\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.025 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 638/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7116/41